  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NZzxdkrV4s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/21f178aff2b64844fefeaf94a3a3a418440fd43f.png\" alt=\"Discord链接至“LopyMine的项目”Discord服务器\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d87060a9e4522786e45b4b54d10853a1b4a91b10.png\" alt=\"Github链接横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252flopymine%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dce91fef079649dee277c52a998fc068e745e99e.png\" alt=\"支持链接横幅\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patpat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c39affcb732c8b1a4fe189e79898c686da3d63e2.png\" alt=\"CurseForge链接横幅\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpatpat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9991553f6a20e5105b9b153b8d817bc3630c18a8.png\" alt=\"Modrinth链接横幅\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/da8941a941917d438a8d2606cac7a3f8fd563cf1.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><h1>💬 描述</h1><p>一个简单的模组，用于轻拍任何（活着的）生物！如果你曾想过抚摸你的宠物，这个模组正是为你准备的！客户端和服务端均可选装！</p><p><strong>按下Shift + 右键来轻拍任何（活着的）生物！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/241f2e2d59483053ded36c5fd41ba80a038258bb.webp\" alt=\"展示图\"></p><h1>🔥 自定义动画</h1><p>你可以创建自己的动画，然后上传到Modrinth或CurseForge，因为这些动画可以通过资源包创建！更多信息请阅读<a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat/wiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wiki</strong></a>。</p><p>下方是开发期间制作的一些自定义动画示例 :D</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5407cbbee00cc38c36ae6cbee0ae16697d0df8d1.webp\" alt=\"展示图\"></p><h2>🌟 Modrinth上更多PatPat动画</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图标</th>\n<th>横幅</th>\n<th>信息</th>\n<th>图标</th>\n<th>横幅</th>\n<th>信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8QPPVFl5/bcd285ea0d6340112aa6af73f3c729345d1a9881_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8QPPVFl5/images/b1ce37657f6c4c369c5ef912fda3deceab213394.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-mpa\" rel=\"nofollow\">LopyMine<br>\"金属管\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/c8bNINvz/ab7bc516a4127858488b7b22ecc111893a90728d_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/c8bNINvz/images/b2b7f4561fea6eb3b0f1dcbbf399a4848239551f.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-tha\" rel=\"nofollow\">LopyMine<br>\"玩具锤\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/y3Tu7AP3/e55f2cff3ec1b8570c6d56296a18c148df214693_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/y3Tu7AP3/images/d848eadef7a552a150ca2a976b64df5a01c39553.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-bba\" rel=\"nofollow\">LopyMine<br>\"邦克邦克\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Fta8IZQ/14f0a198a94dd844fb4cc538b5851781b7a010e7_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Fta8IZQ/images/9d44f286ccd887fcc05a789116047cab306cacd8.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-nuke-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kolplayyy<br>\"核弹\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3uvab0my/42e6a2a8716901b847323d25aad097f81399233c.png\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/3uvab0my/images/3b03a263746f730846d1b1f2cf31613bf9ac9dc5.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-pa\" rel=\"nofollow\">LopyMine<br>\"活塞\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/tffjwWUx/cd98fe811994de00cde99b391a977cf731ecaef7.png\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/tffjwWUx/images/94bdc5265f7e24ec46e280287fbfb2b283044c8c.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-hide-hand\" rel=\"nofollow\">nikita51<br>\"隐藏手\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vHYEYbjp/ce86b7470c62e71e6cb47d0ab0b357882f2ce03c_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vHYEYbjp/images/3ab13052cf8516dd714ab0dd68ce4ee2fecabe8e.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-dripstone-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\">mrlemonhog<br>\"滴水石\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W3Y5hL3V/6bfd21bfebef27c0352c8f7edb3617d7c8143e58_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W3Y5hL3V/images/e5c11b8335892a48dbfd59db48f99fc5bcd1450c.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-mwahmwah\" rel=\"nofollow\">cheat_r<br>\"姆瓦姆瓦\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/njy2rpni/749dda172dc3e9d33e46b2ed63069905fd415967.gif\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/njy2rpni/images/543f1572cc4f69c583eeca89d6fc875250f7c497.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-tm\" rel=\"nofollow\">mrlemonhog<br>\"挠我\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/KuFZ9Umg/1f62fe500e2c69f9cbe188d02435732c27157443_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/KuFZ9Umg/images/034c9b6411325c9d4048bd4d8acc453218c49748_350.webp\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-stop%252c-im-not-pleased\" rel=\"nofollow\">CloudAnit<br>\"停下，我不高兴。\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/F1L3fzb2/f79d46eb236487165e9c9affd7cf74d3461c8bba_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/38aa2948576b40ccd75622f524343d1b70b244d8.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252floomianecstatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">orchestracats<br>\"Loomian狂喜动画\"</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1760dPoQ/e784288ed5e9b951700c6c5b2d4ffa678348f3a1_96.webp\" width=\"100px\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1760dPoQ/images/eb679b9803abf478c4b44eda582532b3c02e6b3b_350.webp\" width=\"150px\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpatpat-murmur\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anya_Krutahehehe<br>\"低语\"</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h1>🎮 多人游戏支持</h1><p>这个模组也支持多人游戏，只需在服务器上添加此模组，你就可以和朋友们一起轻拍生物了！</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LopyMine/PatPat/refs/heads/master/img/multiplayer_showcase.webp\" alt=\"展示图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0e0c2d50f5a1c745e29340a882bc2f9606c90d3.png\" alt=\"展示图\"></p><h1>⚡ PatPat插件</h1><p>如果你的服务器没有安装模组，你可以在Bukkit/Spigot/Paper服务器上安装PatPat插件！此插件为非模组服务器提供了PatPat的服务端功能。</p><p>目前，PatPat插件应支持大多数当前可用的服务器核心，如Bukkit、Spigot、Paper、Folia以及其他分支。我建议你在自己的服务器上进行测试。</p><p><strong>如果你发现此插件在你的服务器上无法工作，请在<a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat-Plugin/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat-Plugin/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github Issues页面</a> <strong>中提交问题.</strong>目前，计划支持Velocity服务器。</p><h1>📔 开源</h1><p>PatPat模组和插件的所有代码都是开源的。任何人都可以阅读并验证！</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PatPat</th>\n<th>链接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>模组</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Github</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/LopyMine/PatPat-Plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Github</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
